  diasporaVariation: `Vreken diaspora is sparse but old, lantern-eyed crypt-keepers serve as spore-cultivators, healers, and ancestral-consultants in every region's burial grounds. A Nordhalla-Vreken (serving the Frozen Archive's glacier-tombs) has adapted to the cold their southern kin cannot bear, their bioluminescence dimmed to a faint blue that the glacier-ice amplifies. A Sundale-Vreken is rare and grim, the volcanic heat distresses their fungal-bonded skin, and they cluster in the deep ash-tombs beneath the Ashen Escarpment. The Bryngloom remains the only region with a large Vreken population; elsewhere they are solitary practitioners, respected, avoided, and slowly losing their Root-Veil connection the further they roam from the wounded land that made them.`,
