  name: 'The Hush-Temptation',
   description: 'Your Ghost-Mycelium bond is a double-edged gift. You can amplify your perception of the Root-Veil to extraordinary levels, tasting every spore-signature within miles, reading the mycelial network\'s deep currents, perceiving the wounded land\'s pulse in ways no Clean bond could ever reach. But the hush sings in your blood, and every amplification brings you closer to the light that does not let go.',
